# Code review ownership — see standards/platform/ci-cd.md §6.
# Place at .github/CODEOWNERS. Key to TEAMS, not individuals. Last match wins.
# Activate "require review from Code Owners" in the branch ruleset.
# (Invalid lines are silently ignored — verify after editing.)

# Catch-all fallback
*               @your-org/core-team

# Area owners (examples)
/infra/         @your-org/platform
/.github/       @your-org/platform
*.tf            @your-org/platform
/frontend/      @your-org/web
/backend/       @your-org/backend
